# THE ORACLE JUDGE, AS PROTECTED CONFIG: a ModernCI tool pin (backend `tools:` entry
# busbar-oracle-judge, key .ci/oracle-judge.pin). The ModernCI daemon downloads it OUTSIDE any run,
# with its forge credential (the release is private), checks the sha256 for the backend's arch,
# and gives checks only the path, in $BUSBAR_ORACLE_JUDGE_PATH. No check ever holds the token.
# These are busbar-release dev-bin's assets (asset ids: GitHub serves a private asset only from the
# API URL, as octet-stream). aarch64 is the judge for BUSBAR_ORACLE_RELEASE_REF
# 63d7256c227a6e0360d241b865641d1abfe0dbe2 (busbar-release #442: the keyed candidate is the shipping
# build, built once, refused unless it is the shipping build's release/busbar and embeds the run key;
# #444: the trusted release-key list; #445: recording workers share one queue, `prepare` builds the
# keyed candidate once and `record --prepared` reuses it; on top of 0dac78dd's #441/#443/#447), built
# by ModernCI (judge-bin-aarch64, static musl) and published by dev-bin-publish 2026-10-28 17:43Z, SIGNED with the
# owner's 2026-10-28 release key (busbar-release-2026-10-28; its .sig verified against that key, and
# refused by the earlier key). x86_64 stays the 151ad095 judge: ModernCI compute is aarch64 only and no
# x86_64 build of this ref exists. Each sha256 equals BUSBAR_ORACLE_SHA256_LINUX_<arch> in .ci/*.yaml,
# verified against the downloaded assets 2026-10-28. Not a branch file (not .yaml).
url:
  x86_64: https://api.github.com/repos/GetBusbar/busbar-release/releases/assets/660620261
  aarch64: https://api.github.com/repos/GetBusbar/busbar-release/releases/assets/685818127
sha256:
  x86_64: 0f6c0433bc2089af5a8958b5e2e237c86c065b15c38e015225fa3faf4ab6f0e8
  aarch64: 778dcf0c1b9f839dc823982cec99d704acd1b9706a5e2475d47544bbd6a63f43
path: busbar-oracle
auth: forge
accept: application/octet-stream
